            <div xml:id="d851">

                <pb facs="0892" n="780" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg780"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 2491/54–56.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Squiers to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-01-12"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 12, 1909</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 416.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In continuation of my dispatch No. 410 of
                    January 1, last, regarding the Costa Rica-Panama boundary dispute, I have the
                    honor to inclose herewith copy of my note No. 174, of January 2, to the foreign
                    office, and reply thereto of January 9, with translation.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. G. Squiers.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d851-a1.xml" xpointer="d851-a1"/>
